<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks dip to 60,054.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks dip to 60,054.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Sept 13 totaled 60,054 bales, off from from 60,609 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, 1,697 decertification orders, 555 cancellations, and 700 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
